      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "the rules and specs   the canon, ADRs and rules files you\nyou already wrote     already keep, converted once into\n                      typed records: okl seed <file>.json\n\nthis codebase         /seed-from-codebase — an agent reads\n                      the repo and proposes records, each\n                      citing the file it found them in\n\noutside material      an article or guide, audited against\n                      your canon before any of it lands",
      "originalText": "the rules and specs   the canon, ADRs and rules files you\nyou already wrote     already keep, converted once into\n                      typed records: okl seed <file>.json\n\nthis codebase         /seed-from-codebase — an agent reads\n                      the repo and proposes records, each\n                      citing the file it found them in\n\noutside material      an article or guide, audited against\n                      your canon before any of it lands",
      "id": "el8"
    },
