      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "one shape, whatever the type — when you see X, do Y:\n  Rule       a convention this codebase follows\n  Decision   a trade-off already made, and the reason\n  Gate       an armed check, and the defect it catches\n  Defect     something that went wrong here once\n  Tombstone  a name that was retired, so it stays dead\nA paragraph cannot be routed into an action. These can.",
      "originalText": "one shape, whatever the type — when you see X, do Y:\n  Rule       a convention this codebase follows\n  Decision   a trade-off already made, and the reason\n  Gate       an armed check, and the defect it catches\n  Defect     something that went wrong here once\n  Tombstone  a name that was retired, so it stays dead\nA paragraph cannot be routed into an action. These can.",
      "id": "el11"
    },
