      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "TTL decays an un-re-earned stamp to STALE, and\nokl metric scores recurrence-after-arming — the one\nnumber the system cannot flatter itself on.",
