      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "text": "clearing drift by re-recording with --verified is the\none move the tool refuses. Run the check again — a\nrecord's own tests are usually the right --run. A\nstamp you can award yourself measures nothing.",
